  "hero": "<section class=\"rsq-hero\"><span class=\"rsq-kicker\">R-SQUARED · VISUAL STUDY</span><h2>Is your regression model better than just guessing the mean?</h2><p>Compare squared prediction mistakes with a fair mean baseline. Learn to calculate R², interpret negative results, recognize data variation, and evaluate models honestly.</p><div class=\"rsq-art\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 440\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"r2title0 r2desc0\"><title id=\"r2title0\">A fair comparison with predicting the mean</title><desc id=\"r2desc0\">For actual values 2,4,6,8 and predictions 3,4,5,8: squared residual sum 2 and total squared deviation from mean 20 give R-squared 0.90.</desc><rect width=\"1000\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#f8fcfd\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#278978\" font-weight=\"850\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">R-SQUARED · VISUAL STUDY</text><text x=\"38\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#2d566b\" font-weight=\"850\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">A fair comparison with predicting the mean</text><rect x=\"31\" y=\"115\" width=\"585\" height=\"256\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d8e5ea\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#4f7e94\" font-weight=\"850\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">OBSERVED vs PREDICTED</text><line x1=\"81\" y1=\"346\" x2=\"573\" y2=\"346\" stroke=\"#8ba9b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"151\" y1=\"296\" x2=\"151\" y2=\"271\" stroke=\"#df9e70\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"151\" cy=\"296\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#3aa58c\"/><circle cx=\"151\" cy=\"271\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#df9e70\"/><text x=\"151\" y=\"373\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#5a7e90\" font-weight=\"600\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">Record 1</text><line x1=\"260\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"260\" y2=\"246\" stroke=\"#df9e70\" stroke-width=\"6\"/><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"246\" r=