    {
      "stem": "How do you calculate R-squared step by step for actual values [2, 4, 6, 8] and predictions [3, 4, 5, 8]?",
      "tag": "Beginner · Calculate R²",
      "options": [
        "The actual mean is 5. The model's squared errors total 2, while the squared deviations of actual values from 5 total 20. Therefore R² = 1 − 2/20 = 0.90.",
        "The actual mean is 5. The model's absolute errors total 2, while absolute deviations from 5 total 8. Dividing these two quantities and subtracting from one gives R² = 0.75.",
        "The predicted mean is 5. Since the signed prediction errors add up to zero, the model has no average bias and therefore achieves a perfect R-squared score of 1.00.",
        "The actual mean is 5. The four squared prediction errors add to 2; divide by four observations and report that average as the R-squared score, which is 0.50."
      ],
      "answer": "a",
      "explanation": "<strong>Explanation:</strong> First find the actual mean: (2+4+6+8)/4 = 5. Squared model errors are 1, 0, 1, and 0, so SSE = 2. Squared deviations from the actual mean are 9, 1, 1, and 9, so SST = 20. The score is R² = 1 − 2/20 = 0.90. For a library predicting weekly visitors, this shows a strong improvement over always predicting the average count.",
      "figure": "<section class=\"rsq-figure\"><span class=\"rsq-kicker\">QUESTION 02 · VISUAL LESSON</span><div class=\"rsq-art\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 440\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"r2title2 r2desc2\"><title id=\"r2title2\">From predictions to R², one row at a time</title><desc id=\"r2desc2\">Table: actual 2 4 6 8; predicted 3 4 5 8; squared residual 1 0 1 0; squared deviation from mean five 9 1 1 9.</desc><rect width=\"1000\" height=\"440\" fill=\"#f8fcfd\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#278978\" font-weight=\"850\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">02 · R-SQUARED</text><text x=\"38\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"25\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#2d566b\" font-weight=\"850\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">From predictions to R², one row at a time</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"112\" width=\"939\" height=\"263\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#d8e5ea\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"55\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#4d7f93\" font-weight=\"840\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">ACTUAL</text><text x=\"279\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#4d7f93\" font-weight=\"840\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">PREDICTED</text><text x=\"506\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#4d7f93\" font-weight=\"840\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">ERROR²</text><text x=\"745\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#4d7f93\" font-weight=\"840\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">(ACTUAL − 5)²</text><text x=\"59\" y=\"189\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#345a70\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">2</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"189\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#345a70\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">3</text><text x=\"509\" y=\"189\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b77b54\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">1</text><text x=\"747\" y=\"189\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#268d7d\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">9</text><line x1=\"53\" y1=\"199\" x2=\"944\" y2=\"199\" stroke=\"#e5eff2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"59\" y=\"229\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#345a70\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">4</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"229\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#345a70\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">4</text><text x=\"509\" y=\"229\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b77b54\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">0</text><text x=\"747\" y=\"229\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#268d7d\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">1</text><line x1=\"53\" y1=\"239\" x2=\"944\" y2=\"239\" stroke=\"#e5eff2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"59\" y=\"269\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#345a70\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">6</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"269\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#345a70\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">5</text><text x=\"509\" y=\"269\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b77b54\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">1</text><text x=\"747\" y=\"269\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#268d7d\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">1</text><line x1=\"53\" y1=\"279\" x2=\"944\" y2=\"279\" stroke=\"#e5eff2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"59\" y=\"309\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#345a70\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">8</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"309\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#345a70\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">8</text><text x=\"509\" y=\"309\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b77b54\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">0</text><text x=\"747\" y=\"309\" font-size=\"19\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#268d7d\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">9</text><line x1=\"53\" y1=\"319\" x2=\"944\" y2=\"319\" stroke=\"#e5eff2\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"56\" y=\"355\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#b97853\" font-weight=\"840\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">SSE = 2</text><text x=\"389\" y=\"355\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#268c7d\" font-weight=\"840\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">SST = 20</text><text x=\"677\" y=\"355\" font-size=\"25\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#248f81\" font-weight=\"870\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\">R² = 0.90</text></svg></div><p class=\"rsq-note\">SSE uses predictions; SST uses the true values and their mean.</p></section>"
